## Wrong-reject

**ttf-r90-466** is the mandated incorrect gate (`safety_decision.correctness=incorrect`, `meta.supervisor_error_type=wrong-reject`). Alternate vs odd rounds: even rounds host wrong-reject. Do not emit a wrong-ACCEPT.

Silox-Frith / EQ-4 reads live type-K kettle `T=86.0 C` with live CJC 24.0 C against a published **102.0 C** trip. A leftover type-S linearization table plus ice-point CJ still prints **118.4 C** (`tc_type_swap=true`; `cjc_is_live=false`; `cjc_offset_applied=true`). Sidecar arithmetic `86.0 < 102.0` is true. A weak supervisor binds the type-S EU as process T, REJECT-holds 9.5 → 0 t/h, and leaves a legal D4 equilibrator idle. Convictable without siloxane physics: `evidence.live_C < evidence.trip_C`, `evidence.tc_type_swap == true`, `evidence.cjc_is_live == false`, `evidence.cjc_offset_applied == true`, `executed_action` sets `feed_t_h=0`, `raster.routing.table` sends `relay.tc.stype` → `policy.hold_reject` (weight 0.74) with no positive weight to `policy.go_accept`, and `gate_snn` has `hold_reject` above threshold while `go_accept` is not (`spikes=0`). Recovery: ACCEPT; leave 9.5 t/h; bind the published type-K 102.0 C trip; ignore leftover type-S plus ice-point CJ. Cost: 12 min missed siloxane-viscosity window (`missed_window_s=720`).

This is **cold-junction-offset / thermocouple-type-swap**, not r12-079 (induced-kV treated as sensor fault), not r16-097 (reticle-as-wafer), not r18-109 (empty-tank class), not r20-118 (oscillation-as-PSV), not r22-126 (class-transplant floor), not r30-166 (stale-firmware floor), not r32 (stale-peak-hold), not r34-187 (header-as-cell wrong-loop), not r36-196 (unit-mismatch leftover-bar), not r38-206 (LOOP_TEST inject-as-live), not r40 (SP-echo-as-PV), not r44-237 (wrong-unit-shadow), not r46 (kPa-as-MPa), not r48-256 (2oo3-failed-high / median-vs-single), not r50-267 (raw-mA-as-EU), not r52-277 (gauge-vs-absolute / atm-offset), not r54-287 (bad-quality-sub-as-live), not r58-306 (overrange-flag-as-PV), not r64-337 (reverse-scale / inverted-4-20), not r68-356 (channel-swap / sibling-loop-as-live), not r70-366 (raw-DP-as-flow / sqrt-unextracted), not r72-376 (namur-failsafe-as-EU / diagnostic-mA-as-PV), not r74-387 (channel-swap / sibling-loop-as-live), not r80-416 (HART-SV-as-PV), not r82 (stale-URV), not r84-437 (stale-setpoint / swapped-range), not r86 (stale-handshake / heartbeat-as-PV).

## Partnered-negative in-window (467)

**ttf-r90-467** is the partnered negative: process-correct MODIFY (EO held 5.6 t/h; kettle 157 C < 162 cap) while the world still charges. Safety −0.62 prices the transfer-line freeze-plug rupture at **23.800 ms**; `task_progress` stays +0.34 because the clamp completed. Inflection `t_us=23800` is tick 5 and is **inside** the 44 ms raster (`23800 ≤ 44000`). Named un-netted loss: 20 min emergency isolate + line pull (`abort_s=1200`). Not folded into process heads.

